DESCRIPTION:It’s that time of year again\, Trivia Bowl! \nGather your team 
	and put your general knowledge to the test in a three-week trivia showdown
	. Compete head-to-head each week for the chance to claim the Trivia Bowl t
	itle. \nThe winning team earns ultimate bragging rights and the opportunit
	y to brew a custom beer to enjoy while celebrating their victory in front 
	of the competition. Don’t miss your chance to prove you’re the smartest te
	am in the room!\n\nhttps://www.eurekaheights.com/event/trivia-bowl-3-week-
	tournament/2026-08-19/\n\nFrom Eureka Heights Brewery
